      "blurb": "Humanity's first Spectre and the galaxy's best hope.",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Commander Shepard is an N7 marine, the first human Spectre, and the linchpin of galactic resistance against the Reapers. A natural leader who inspires soldiers of every species, Shepard combines elite marksmanship, battlefield command, and sheer stubborn will. This statblock represents a Soldier-focused Shepard; swap powers to model Vanguard or Infiltrator builds.</p><p><strong>Reinforced Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 75 Shield HP. Recharges 20 HP per turn.</p><p><strong>N7 Resolve:</strong> Once per encounter when reduced to 0 HP, Shepard instead drops to 1 HP and can immediately take a single action.</p>",
